Error%2C%27tamper%20%27%2Bindex%29%3B%0A%20%20%7D%0A%7D%29%3B%0A%0Atest%28%27both%20actual%20isolated%20model%20overlays%20load%20using%20the%20updated%20exact%20current%20provider%20receipts%27%2Casync%28%29%3D%3E%7B%0A%20%20for%28const%20create%20of%20%5BcreateRustTextCertificatePublicOverlay%2CcreateRustRawBindingCertificateOverlay%5D%29%7B%0A%20%20%20%20const%20overlay%3Dawait%20create%28%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20try%7B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20assert.equal%28overlay.receipts.length%2C5%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20assert.equal%28typeof%20overlay.api.createTypedProgramLinks%2C%27function%27%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20assert.equal%28typeof%20overlay.javascript.emitJavaScript%2C%27function%27%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20assert.equal%28typeof%20overlay.validation.validateLinkedTypedProgram%2C%27function%27%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%7Dfinally%7Boverlay.dispose%28%29%3B%7D%0A%20%20%7D%0A%7D%29%3B%0A%0Atest%28%27normal%20source%20review%20refreshes%20only%20current%20receipts%20and%20retains%20both%20immutable%20original%20overlays%27%2Casync%28%29%3D%3E%7B%0A%20%20const%20paths%3DreviewedOverlayProviderPolicy.historicalOverlays.map%28row%3D%3E%27experiments%2F%27%2Brow.experiment%2B%27%2Fdata%2Foverlays.lino%27%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20before%3Dpaths.map%28read%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20packet%3Dawait%20generateReviewedOverlayProviderSuccession%28%7Bcheck%3Atrue%7D%29%3B%0A%20%20assert.deepEqual%28packet%2CreadReviewedOverlayProviderSuccession%28%29%29%3B%0A%20%20paths.forEach%28%28path%2Cindex%29%3D%3Eassert.deepEqual%28read%28path%29%2Cbefore%5Bindex%5D%29%29%3B%0A%20%20assert.deepEqual%28readProjectData%28new%20URL%28%27experiments%2Frust-text-certificate-adapter%2Fdata%2Fprovider-revisions.lino%27%2Croot%29%29%2CreviewedOverlayProviderPolicy%29%3B%0A%7D%29%3B%0A%0A%0Atest%28%27a%20real%20appended%20source%20epoch%20preserves%20the%20complete%20original%20packet%20policy%20receipts%20and%20exact%20only-emitter%20source%20inverse%27%2Casync%28%29%3D%3E%7B%0A%20%20const%20packet%3DreadReviewed