(104224: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: %23%21%2Fusr%2Fbin%2Fenv%20node%0A%2F%2F%20Partitions%20the%20JavaScript%20test%20files%20into%20the%20groups%20CI%20runs%20as%20separate%0A%2F%2F%20jobs%2C%20so%20no%20single%20job%20runs%20the%20whole%20suite%20in%20one%20process.%0A%2F%2F%0A%2F%2F%20%20%20node%20scripts%2Ftest-groups.mjs%20--check%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20every%20test%20file%20is%20in%20exactly%20one%20group%0A%2F%2F%20%20%20node%20scripts%2Ftest-groups.mjs%20--list%20GROUP%20%20%20print%20the%20files%20of%20GROUP%0A%2F%2F%20%20%20node%20scripts%2Ftest-groups.mjs%20--run%20GROUP%20%20%20%20run%20GROUP%20with%20node%20--test%0A%2F%2F%20%20%20%20%20%5B--shard%20K%2FN%5D%20%28or%20TEST_GROUP_SHARD%3DK%2FN%29%20partitions%20files%20exactly%20once%0A%2F%2F%0A%2F%2F%20A%20new%20test%20file%20that%20no%20group%20claims%20fails%20--check%20%28and%20every%20--run%29%2C%20so%20a%0A%2F%2F%20file%20can%20never%20silently%20drop%20out%20of%20CI.%0Aimport%20%7B%20spawnSync%2CexecFileSync%20%7D%20from%20%27node%3Achild_process%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7B%20readdirSync%2CreadFileSync%20%7D%20from%20%27node%3Afs%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7BcreateHash%7D%20from%20%27node%3Acrypto%27%3B%0Aimport%20assert%20from%20%27node%3Aassert%2Fstrict%27%3B%0Aimport%20path%20from%20%27node%3Apath%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7B%20fileURLToPath%20%7D%20from%20%27node%3Aurl%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7BreadProjectData%2CwriteProjectData%7D%20from%20%27.%2Fproject-data.mjs%27%3B%0A%0Aconst%20packageRoot%20%3D%20path.resolve%28path.dirname%28fileURLToPath%28import.meta.url%29%29%2C%20%27..%27%29%3B%0Aconst%20schedulingFile%3Dnew%20URL%28%27..%2F..%2Fparity%2Ffixtures%2Fci-39615628279-workload-costs.lino%27%2Cimport.meta.url%29%3B%0Aconst%20schedulingRevision%3D%278bc0ef9725388c7927acf1854870bf46f5e365be%27%3B%0Aconst%20schedulingDigest%3Dvalue%3D%3EcreateHash%28%27sha256%27%29.update%28value%29.digest%28%27hex%27%29%3B%0A%0A%2F%2A%2A%20Largest%20observed%20workload%20first%3B%20source%20changes%20use%20